{"v":1,"book":"gita","n":0,"voice":"en-GB-SoniaNeural","engine":"edge","duration":354.672,"segs":[{"b":0,"part":0,"text":"The Bhagavad-Gita is a doctrine of universal truth and a book of moral and spiritual growth. Its message is sublime and non-sectarian. It deals with the most sacred metaphysical science. It imparts the knowledge of the Self and answers two universal questions: Who am I, and how can I lead a happy and peaceful life in this word full of dualities and dilemmas?","start":0.0,"dur":22.848,"words":[[0.138,0.138,"The"],[0.287,1.038,"Bhagavad-Geeta"],[1.337,0.188,"is"],[1.538,0.075,"a"],[1.625,0.475,"doctrine"],[2.112,0.1,"of"],[2.225,0.65,"universal"],[2.888,0.475,"truth"],[3.375,0.15,"and"],[3.538,0.062,"a"],[3.612,0.212,"book"],[3.837,0.138,"of"],[3.987,0.425,"moral"],[4.425,0.113,"and"],[4.55,0.588,"spiritual"],[5.15,0.525,"growth"],[6.075,0.2,"Its"],[6.287,0.512,"message"],[6.812,0.175,"is"],[7.0,0.6,"sublime"],[7.612,0.175,"and"],[7.8,1.025,"non-sectarian"],[9.225,0.188,"It"],[9.425,0.45,"deals"],[9.887,0.138,"with"],[10.037,0.087,"the"],[10.137,0.362,"most"],[10.512,0.537,"sacred"],[11.062,0.662,"metaphysical"],[11.738,0.7,"science"],[12.838,0.125,"It"],[12.975,0.5,"imparts"],[13.488,0.1,"the"],[13.6,0.312,"knowledge"],[13.925,0.087,"of"],[14.025,0.1,"the"],[14.137,0.4,"Self"],[14.55,0.163,"and"],[14.725,0.463,"answers"],[15.2,0.212,"two"],[15.425,0.562,"universal"],[16.0,0.625,"questions"],[16.988,0.113,"Who"],[17.113,0.113,"am"],[17.238,0.3,"I"],[17.788,0.1,"and"],[17.9,0.163,"how"],[18.075,0.163,"can"],[18.25,0.062,"I"],[18.325,0.275,"lead"],[18.613,0.037,"a"],[18.663,0.438,"happy"],[19.113,0.138,"and"],[19.262,0.438,"peaceful"],[19.712,0.338,"life"],[20.062,0.1,"in"],[20.175,0.175,"this"],[20.363,0.338,"word"],[20.712,0.175,"full"],[20.9,0.1,"of"],[21.012,0.65,"dualities"],[21.675,0.113,"and"],[21.8,0.688,"dilemmas"]]},{"b":1,"part":0,"text":"It's a timeless book of wisdom that inspired Thoreau, Emerson, Einstein, Oppenheimer, Gandhi and many 